  "description": "Polaris ClickHouse v1: Kafka-engine ingestion lag and materialized-view state from the analytics-projector's probe poller (PI2CRFZC); analytics insert health, proxied via the analytics-projector processor metrics; operator-escape-hatch usage. Native query-rate / query-p99 / parts-count panels are still gaps \u2014 see About panel.",
